sequenceDiagram
autonumber
participant U as unary()
participant D as MadDetector
U->>D: construct fresh instance
loop each finite scalar
    U->>D: update(value)
    Note over D: Validate before appending to bounded reference deque
    alt fewer than data_max_size points
        D-->>U: 0.0, ready=false
    else ready
        D->>D: _mean_absolute_deviation(last window)
        D->>D: _mean_absolute_deviation(full reference)
        alt reference MAD is zero
            D-->>U: 0.0 if local MAD is zero, else 1.0
        else reference MAD positive
            Note over D: relative = abs(local - reference) / reference
            D-->>U: tanh(relative * 0.5)
        end
    end
    Note over U: Warmup stored as None, this MAD uses MEAN, not median
end
